Package: sentinelcore
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Dognet Technologies <info@dognet.tech>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://dognet.tech
Depends: postgresql, nginx, nmap, arp-scan, ca-certificates, curl, openssl, libssl3t64, sudo, avahi-utils, samba-common-bin, iproute2
Description: SentinelCore - Vulnerability Management Platform
 Server SentinelCore della SentinelSuite: backend Rust e frontend React dietro
 nginx. Il primo install crea database e configurazione, gli aggiornamenti
 eseguono backup del database e migration.
